window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>This sexy billionaire is ready to become a husband, even if he has to buy his bride.</p> <p>Miles Deveraux has more money than one man needs, but his shady past continues to cause problems. When he decides it’s time to get married, using a discreet matchmaker to find him a wife seems the best choice...until he meets the perfect candidate on his own.</p> <p>Life in the big city hasn’t gone the way Emma James expected. Faced with the prospect of losing her home, Miles’ offer of marriage saves her.</p> <p>But once the ring is on her finger, Miles wants more.</p>"; 
